    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d241">

                <pb facs="0354" n="242" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg242"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 818.00/340</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Panama</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Price</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-02-27T14:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 27, 1918, 2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Volio is begging earnestly to be permitted to leave in view of the outbreaks in
                    Costa Rica, about which we get only limited and somewhat contradictory reports,
                    indicating them to be sporadic but occurring in various sections. If permitted
                    to go, he says he would still try to reach Nicaragua and invade the Guanacaste
                    region of Costa Rica. Please instruct.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Price</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
